        "code": {
          "language": "plaintext",
          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        },
        "content": "## MLOps Model Performance\n\nModel-centric view: prediction volume, confidence distribution, latency percentiles, model version tracking, and reload history.\n\n### Key Panels\n| Panel | What to look for |\n|:------|:-----------------|\n| Total Predictions (24h) | Prediction throughput \u2014 flat line means no traffic |\n| Confidence P75/P95 | Should stay above 0.75 \u2014 drop indicates distribution shift |\n| Prediction Distribution | Class balance \u2014 healthy (0) vs faulty (1) split |\n| Model Reloads (Daily) | How often the model is reloaded \u2014 each bar = a retraining event |\n| Last Model Load Time | Seconds taken to load the model on last reload |\n\n**Data sources:** `model_predictions_total`, `model_prediction_confidence` (histogram), `model_reloads_total`, `model_info_info`, `model_load_time_seconds`\n\n*Last updated: Session 10 \u2014 GF-14 stat panel fix applied*",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "10.2.3",
      "title": "Dashboard Information",
      "type": "text"
